%%label Movement I
%%note G minor. Viola and second violin rock through an eight-chord cycle in mirrored arpeggios over a held cello; the first violin adds a slow line; a brighter middle section sets three against two; the cycle returns with everything in motion and then thins out.
X:1
T:Glass’s Missing Quartet
T:Movement I
C:Lor, in the manner of Philip Glass
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=112
%%score [v1 | v2 | va | vc]
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
K:Gm
V:v1
%%MIDI program 40
V:v2
%%MIDI program 40
V:va
%%MIDI program 41
V:vc
%%MIDI program 42
